{"4205650": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ash Hills: Descent", "steam_appid": 4205650, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205650/extras/05f97966310c53597ca4972a6a648a76.webp?t=1788068715\" width=455 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disturbing reports are increasingly reaching the Forestry Service: animals found on the outskirts of <i><strong>Ash Hills</strong></i> are discovered twisted into unnatural poses, their bodies brutally mutilated and butchered.<br>This area has gone unmonitored for a long time, and now the management sends you, ranger <strong>Ethan Crawley</strong>, to uncover what is happening. Your task is to set up a base in an abandoned cabin, install surveillance cameras, and establish constant monitoring of the perimeter. The Forestry Service believes poachers are responsible.   <br>But from your very first steps into <i><strong>Ash Hills</strong></i>, it becomes clear — this forsaken forest hides a far more terrifying secret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205650/extras/0d97f74638f1e2a83da2ca1ef5445a30.webp?t=1788068715\" width=455 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205650/extras/be123dad098f99b3a44cd5ce8ad69423.poster.avif?t=1788068715\" width=648 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205650/extras/be123dad098f99b3a44cd5ce8ad69423.webm?t=1788068715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205650/extras/be123dad098f99b3a44cd5ce8ad69423.mp4?t=1788068715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The surveillance system allows you to <strong>monitor the perimeter around the clock</strong>. Discover <strong>who</strong> left behind a bloody trail of corpses. But remember: while you watch through the cameras, something is watching you as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205650/extras/ccc0b3923f3e984031755f5969d453ef.webp?t=1788068715\" width=455 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205650/extras/b76e2f0872be92dfe9f5188666866dfd.poster.avif?t=1788068715\" width=648 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205650/extras/b76e2f0872be92dfe9f5188666866dfd.webm?t=1788068715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205650/extras/b76e2f0872be92dfe9f5188666866dfd.mp4?t=1788068715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> the environment and <strong>interact</strong> with objects to uncover the horrors unfolding in <strong><i>Ash Hills</i></strong>. The items and documents you find will help piece together the truth — and perhaps offer a chance to escape <strong><i>Ash Hills</i></strong> alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205650/extras/ef1d4ec5fc2108a4539dfb14364af9af.webp?t=1788068715\" width=455 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205650/extras/6f4958fb8652bf7da678c4dafa4f49c8.poster.avif?t=1788068715\" width=648 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205650/extras/6f4958fb8652bf7da678c4dafa4f49c8.webm?t=1788068715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205650/extras/6f4958fb8652bf7da678c4dafa4f49c8.mp4?t=1788068715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are issued a shotgun for protection against wild animals. Keep it <strong>loaded</strong> — here, beneath the oppressive darkness of the trees, wild animals may be the least of your fears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205650/extras/581f0ed2ffa599e01c4f111adf62ec85.webp?t=1788068715\" width=455 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205650/extras/614e5c390cbb692daf49a91d1fecbd97.poster.avif?t=1788068715\" width=648 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205650/extras/614e5c390cbb692daf49a91d1fecbd97.webm?t=1788068715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205650/extras/614e5c390cbb692daf49a91d1fecbd97.mp4?t=1788068715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the heart of unimaginable horror, you must hold onto your sanity and do everything possible to escape. Can a person endure pain, fear, and despair in the name of survival — and still remain human? <br><br><i>Contact with it means the collapse of identity. The human mind cannot endure the realization of all living things as a single, distorted body.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205650/extras/05f97966310c53597ca4972a6a648a76.webp?t=1788068715\" width=455 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disturbing reports are increasingly reaching the Forestry Service: animals found on the outskirts of <i><strong>Ash Hills</strong></i> are discovered twisted into unnatural poses, their bodies brutally mutilated and butchered.<br>This area has gone unmonitored for a long time, and now the management sends you, ranger <strong>Ethan Crawley</strong>, to uncover what is happening. Your task is to set up a base in an abandoned cabin, install surveillance cameras, and establish constant monitoring of the perimeter. The Forestry Service believes poachers are responsible.   <br>But from your very first steps into <i><strong>Ash Hills</strong></i>, it becomes clear — this forsaken forest hides a far more terrifying secret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205650/extras/0d97f74638f1e2a83da2ca1ef5445a30.webp?t=1788068715\" width=455 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205650/extras/be123dad098f99b3a44cd5ce8ad69423.poster.avif?t=1788068715\" width=648 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4205650/extras/be123dad098f99b3a44cd5ce8ad69423.webm?t=1788068715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/ste